data.summary:
Added CAP-4.1 to CAP-4.6 in the new canon/capabilities/CAP-4.md, an in-play score display capability with bindings P0-UI-009 to P0-UI-014. The criteria cover:
- the score is visible while the game is played;
- the score sits in the same row as the lives;
- eating a dot, a pellet and a frightened ghost raises it by 10, 50 and 200;
- the end screens show the score the display showed on the last step.

